The Oreskalka Cabal is the vampire family of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]], seated at [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Umbervale Hold|Umbervale Hold]], which stands over the mine that leads down to the body of [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Nox|Nox]]. Their strain of [[Phenomena/Althane/Sanguis Noxa|Sanguis Noxa]] began with the first vampire, who by [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev's]] account was a slave at the hold: before Oresk was a country, a cruel master there made the slave eat something the hold kept, and the slave rose with vampiric powers and began the family. Lev holds that the other cabals started at Umbervale too, each carrying away its own bloodline and so its own strain.

All known ways into the mine under the hold are held either by the cabal or by the [[Org/Althane/The First House|Oreskian government]]. Lev left the family with his sire and is not welcome back, though he would like its headship; among the family, that would mean having someone on the inside willing to raise him up, not walking in and taking it.
